  "published": "2026-09-18T11:43:35.203Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "DateOnlyColumn and TimeOnlyColumn, with InputFormat, OutputFormat and FormatProvider; Property overloads on both type mappers for DateOnly, DateOnly?, TimeOnly and TimeOnly?, DateOnlyProperty and TimeOnlyProperty on the dynamic mappers, auto-mapping of both types, and GetDateOnly and GetTimeOnly on the data reader. Mappers now detect a runtime without dynamic code (Native AOT, or the IsDynamicCodeSupported switch off) and use reflection instead of Reflection.Emit, so a published AOT application maps entities without throwing. A column is given a ColumnContext only when a hook, a custom null formatter or default value, a complex column or a subclass could read it; errors still carry a full context. Typed reads allocate about a third less. The package carries the XML documentation for every public member and a symbol package with Source Link. Source-compatible with 7.3.0 and validated against it at pack time.",
